  "description": "<p>This pink bear soap dispensing cleaning brush simplifies your kitchen and bathroom cleaning tasks. Its innovative 2-in-1 design combines a sturdy scrub brush with a built-in liquid dispenser, making everyday scrubbing convenient and efficient. The ergonomic, animal-shaped plastic body ensures a comfortable grip, while the easy push mechanism releases cleaning liquid precisely when needed.</p><h2>Key features</h2><ul>\n<li>2-in-1 design integrates a scrub brush and liquid dispenser.</li>\n<li>Built-in holder keeps cleaning liquid readily available.</li>\n<li>Top push mechanism for controlled liquid dispensing.</li>\n<li>Firm bristles effectively scrub various household surfaces.</li>\n<li>Cute pink bear shape adds a playful touch to your cleaning tools.</li>\n<li>Compact plastic body offers a comfortable and secure grip.</li>\n<li>Manual operation requires no batteries or charging.</li>\n<li>Easy-to-store design for hassle-free daily household cleaning.</li>\n</ul><h2>Materials &amp; care</h2><p>Crafted from durable plastic with synthetic bristles, this soap dispensing cleaning brush is designed for longevity. To clean, rinse thoroughly with water after each use and allow to air dry.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><dl>\n<dt>Q1: What is a pink bear soap dispensing cleaning brush?</dt>\n<dd>A: A pink bear soap dispensing cleaning brush is a versatile cleaning tool featuring a cute bear design, integrated liquid soap dispenser, and firm bristles for efficient scrubbing in kitchens and bathrooms.</dd>\n<dt>Q2: How do I dispense soap with this brush?</dt>\n<dd>A: Simply press the top mechanism on the brush to release cleaning liquid from the built-in holder as you scrub.</dd>\n<dt>Q3: Is this brush suitable for all surfaces?</dt>\n<dd>A: Its firm bristles are effective for scrubbing common household surfaces in the kitchen and bathroom, including sinks, tiles, and countertops.</dd>\n<dt>Q4: What are the dimensions of this cleaning brush?</dt>\n<dd>A: This compact cleaning brush measures approximately 6 x 11 cm, making it easy to handle and store.</dd>\n<dt>Q5: Is the pink bear soap dispensing cleaning brush durable?</dt>\n<dd>A: Yes, it is made from durable plastic with synthetic bristles, designed for regular and long-lasting household use.</dd>\n</dl>",
